Audience group selection criteria
title end

paragraph start
A group is a set of people who share one problem the brand can help with and one place where they can be reached. Choose groups by that shared problem, not by age or country alone.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Start with few groups, one primary and one secondary, because every group needs its own language and its own content.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Test: can you name where the group spends time and one thing it asked for this month.
paragraph end

